Yoda Translator
===============

App source code: MIT License, see LICENSE.

Model (yoda-gemma3-1b.litertlm, published as a release asset)
-------------------------------------------------------------
The model is a fine-tuned derivative of Gemma 3 1B (instruction-tuned).
Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms
Use of the model must also follow the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy:
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy
Modification: LoRA fine-tuning on English and Norwegian Yoda-speak rewrites,
merged into the base weights and converted to LiteRT-LM with 8-bit weights and
4-bit embeddings.

Training sentences
------------------
Source sentences come from Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org), licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 France (CC BY 2.0 FR). The Yoda rewrites used
as training targets were generated with Claude Sonnet (Anthropic). The training
corpus itself is not distributed in this repository.
